# =============================================================================
#  assets/creatures/encounters.def  —  what lives in which patch of long grass
# =============================================================================
#      table <name> <species>:<weight>:<lo>-<hi> ...
#
#  Weights are RELATIVE and do not have to sum to anything. That is not laziness:
#  a table being balanced gets entries added to it, and renormalising the rest by
#  hand is exactly how a creature meant to be rare silently becomes common.
#
#  Two tables, and the difference between them is the only progression the route
#  has: the near grass is the three starters' lines at low level, the far grass is
#  everything, higher, and holds the only stage-2 you can meet in the wild.
# =============================================================================
table near 1:25:3-5  4:25:3-5  7:25:3-5  16:25:2-4
table far  1:12:6-9  4:12:6-9  7:12:6-9  10:16:6-9 13:16:6-9 16:12:5-8 2:7:9-11 11:7:9-11 14:6:9-11
